+/*
+ * Whether converting @source_color_state to @target_color_state compresses
+ * the gamut, by get_gamut_compression(): toward a display gamut target, and
+ * only when the content can exceed it. The renderer adds the compression
+ * exactly when this returns %TRUE. It returns early, without computing any
